  "release_changes": "## 🚀 Features\n\n- feat(rules,allowlist): exclude Cargo test/benchmark paths and refine Rust rules (#1971)\n- feat(review): add optional behavior and impact analysis (#1937)\n- feat(cli): order review and scan findings by severity (#2003)\n- feat(rules): add SQL review rules (#1941)\n- feat(rules): add Dhall review rules (#963)\n- feat(rules): add Ruby review rules (#1940)\n- feat(allowlist): add CUDA (.cu/.cuh) and HIP (.hip) review support (#1768)\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- fix(viewer): keep the report header stable across tabs (#2022)\n- fix(review): include TypeScript module extensions (#1962)\n- fix(mcp): match tool definitions to their registered server (#1972)\n- fix(pages): recover partial-locale fallback and fragment navigation (#2000)\n- fix(gitlab_ci): stop posting a check-mark LGTM on a failed review (#1999)\n\n## 📖 Documentation\n\n- docs(configuration): explain remote Chat Completions providers (#2005)\n- docs(review-rules): explain specification-aware reviews (#2006)\n- docs(cli): sync severity ordering across translations (#2015)\n\n## Other Changes\n\n- perf(viewer): avoid copying owned JSONL records (#1967)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/compare/v1.13.13...v1.14.0",
